; Add these records to the existing BIND9 zone used by the VPS.
; Replace YOUR_VPS_IP with the public IPv4 of the VPS.
;
; The three names must resolve to the same VPS:
;
eyetoychat-master.online.scee.com.  IN A YOUR_VPS_IP
eyetoychat-update.online.scee.com.  IN A YOUR_VPS_IP
vmail.online.scee.com.              IN A YOUR_VPS_IP
